INSERT INTO corpus VALUES(2132,'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6865193','Sleep-Related Disorders in Neurology and Psychiatry.','Rémi J, Pollmächer T, Spiegelhalder K, Trenkwalder C, Young P.','2019','somnolence zopiclone restfulness pragmatically icsd icsd insomnias hypersomnolence cataplexy parasomnias somnambulism jetlag indigestion icsd regrouped dgsm schlafmedizin dgn nervenheilkunde insomnias bedroom nonorganic nonorganic psychoeducation reassociation cognitions cognitions healthiest insomnias zopiclone e19 doxepin trimipramine e23 melperone pipamperone butyrophenones gerontopsychiatry insomnias rls polyneuropathies sedating ergic zopiclone nonorganic e24 jetlag e26 actimetry awakenings adaption periodicity e27 timer actimetry e28 actimetry melatoninergic e29 tasimelteon e31 e32 epworth e33 mslt dsps ddx non24 plmd rls srbd hypersomnolence hypersomnia monotonous hypersomnolence uncontrollable cataplexy cataplexy cataplexy facultative hypnagogic hypnopompic dqb1 e35 e35 pathophysiologically hypocretin orexin wakefulness hypocretin e36 hypocretin mslt naps e37 ma2 e38 dgsm posology modafinil e39 e40 e39 pitolisant e41 cataplexy e41 oxybate cataplexy e39 e42 clomipramine cataplexy e39 e43 cataplexy e39 e44 hypersomnia hypersomnia cataplexy mslt modafinil hypersomnia e45 e46 e47 e48 e49 e50 e51 bedpartner parasomnias sleepwalking parasomnias nrem parasomnias parasomnias nrem parasomnias nrem parasomnias terrors screaming somnambulism e52 sleepwalkers somnambulistic sleepers e53 e54 nrem parasomnias e55 somnambulism zopiclone zaleplon reboxetine chlorprothixene somnambulism zopiclone anecdotic vocalizations shouting screaming rbdsq oversleep e56 e57 e58 rls rls e59 e60 e61 rls formication plms rls complain rls contestable e62 rls rls rls e63 rls rls aggravating e64 e65 rls pramipexole ropinirole rotigotine rls e66 rls rls rls e66 ralf thoene trenkwalder benevolent grunenthal mundipharma vifor remi vanda vanda bioproject saute adboard medice vanda genzyme m