INSERT INTO corpus VALUES(2187,'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC8354906','Pharmacotherapy of 1,044 inpatients with posttraumatic stress disorder: current status and trends in German-speaking countries.','Reinhard MA, Seifert J, Greiner T, Toto S, Bleich S, Grohmann R.','2020','arzneimittelsicherheit sectionally psychotropics psychotropics tranquilizing tranquilizing hyperarousal intrusive flashbacks vivid hyperarousal nightmares cognitions rumination hoskins bromaforine nefazodone prazosin doxazosin ng116 arzneimittelsicherheit 8100_bo_s_2018 f43 overseen tranquilizing zopiclone nitrazepam flurazepam lormetazepam antiparkinsonian biperiden nootropics ssnri noradrenergic nassa fga fga dissociative somatoform delusional psychotropics psychotropics tranquilizing ssnris nassas sgas fgas fgas tranquilizing psychotropics ssnri nassa fga fga tranquilizing tranquilizers tranquilizers antiparkinson nootropics psychotropics ssnri nassa noradrenergic agomelatine reboxetine fga psychotropics doxazosin prazosin psychotropics chlorprothixene trimipramine psychotropics nassas ssnri nassa tranquilizing psychotropics tranquilizing reboxetine agomelatine psychotropics ssnri nassa fga fga tranquilizing ssnri nassa noradrenergic fga tranquilizing psychotropics tranquilizing ssnris ssnri agomelatine sgas fgas tranquilizing psychotropics noradrenergic nassa ssnri sgas tranquilizing psychopharmacotherapy psychotropics psychotropics psychotropics psychotropics delusional psychotropics psychotropics hyperarousal nightmares sgas villarreal hyperarousal nightmares sgas hoskins hyperarousal psychotropics valuably psychopharmacological alia psychotropics hyperarousal fofole fofole mcsp maximilian honoria zeneca germania lederle ciba geigy desitin duphar esparma knoll niederlassung homburg nordmark organon pharmacia upjohn promonta recordati rhone poulenc synthelabo smithklinebeecham solvay synthelabo wilmar schwabe thiemann troponwerke upjohn wander desitin essex chemie organon pharmac